@startuml seq-consume-settle
' ============================================================
'  消费时序图（下半）重构后：扣款 → 支付 → 记账 → 通知 → 返回
'  对应文档：第 1 章 项目介绍 —— 图 1-2
' ============================================================
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam participantFontSize 20
skinparam actorFontSize 20
skinparam arrowFontSize 19
skinparam noteFontSize 18
skinparam titleFontSize 26
skinparam dpi 200
autonumber
title 图 1-2  消费时序图②：结算与通知

actor "调用方" as Caller
participant "CardService\n(Facade)" as Svc
participant "StandardConsumeFlow\n(Template Method)" as Flow
participant "Card\n(State::Context)" as Card
participant "PaymentGateway\n(Adapter + 工厂)" as Gateway
participant "Ledger / MerchantAccount\n(Composite + Visitor)" as Acc
participant "EventPublisher\n(Observer)" as Pub

Caller -> Svc : consume(...)  （前置与计费见 图 1-1）
Svc -> Flow : settle(context)
Flow -> Card : decreaseBalance(paid) / addTodaySpent(paid)
Flow -> Gateway : gatewayFor(card.type()).pay(cardId, amount)
Gateway --> Flow : channel（ALIPAY / WECHAT）
Flow -> Acc : ledger.addConsumed(paid)\nmerchantAccount.record(paid)
Flow -> Pub : publish(CardEvent.CONSUME, ...)
Pub -> Pub : SmsListener / AppPushListener / EmailListener.onEvent(event)
Pub --> Flow :
Flow --> Svc : Result.ok(paid, balance)
Svc --> Caller : Result(status=OK, paid, balance)

note over Flow
  结算步骤由模板方法的 settle() 落实，
  具体算法分别委托给 Adapter、Composite/Visitor、Observer。
end note

@enduml
